Description: FlickOS kit: apps for students
 Apps for studying from Debian, for secondary school and university:
 Xournal++ (handwritten notes, and writing on PDFs), LabPlot (graphs and
 data), KWordQuiz (flashcards) and Artha (an English dictionary and
 thesaurus that works offline).
 .
 A kit is installed from Software and removed there too. Nothing it
 installs runs until it is used (docs/design/flickos-dev.md, Q16).
